# LF everywhere, in the repo and in the working tree.
#
# `core.autocrlf` is on for this machine, which would check every file out as
# CRLF while storing LF — so the bytes on disk differ from the bytes committed.
# That is invisible until something reads the file as text and the offsets no
# longer match, and it would make every mac/linux CI checkout a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.dll binary
*.nupkg binary
*.zip binary
